                <pb facs="0162" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg78"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Inscription on monument erected by the Chinese
                        Government to Baron von Ketteler.</hi></head>
                <p>This monument has been erected by order of His Majesty the Emperor of China for
                    the Imperial German Minister Baron von Ketteler, who fell on this spot by
                    heinous murder on the 20th of June, 1900, in everlasting commemoration of his
                    name, as an eternal token of the Emperor’s wrath about this crime, as a warning
                    to all.</p>
            </div>
